&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role leads communications for Block&#39;s lending and financial access initiatives across our core businesses, including Square, Cash App, and Square Financial Services. You&#39;ll own the communications strategy that connects our lending, banking, and broader financial institution initiatives into a cohesive corporate narrative, helping explain how Block is expanding access to financial tools for consumers and small businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with leaders across Square Financial Services, Legal, Risk, Compliance, Underwriting, Product, and Communications, you&#39;ll develop executive narratives, thought leadership, and proactive storytelling that strengthens Block&#39;s reputation while supporting business growth. You&#39;ll help ensure Block communicates with a clear, consistent, and trusted voice as we continue building the future of financial access.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own communications strategy for Block&#39;s lending and financial access initiatives across Square, Cash App, and Square Financial Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a cohesive corporate narrative that connects lending, banking, and financial institution initiatives across Block beyond individual product announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Square Financial Services, Legal, Risk, Compliance, Underwriting, Product, and business teams to develop communications strategies, executive messaging, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build creative storytelling campaigns that demonstrate how Block is expanding access to financial tools for consumers and small businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage an always-on communications program featuring customer and seller stories that highlight how Block&#39;s lending and financial products help businesses grow, improve cash flow, and expand access to capital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive communications, media engagement, speaking opportunities, and key business milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Corporate Communications to ensure lending and financial access narratives are consistently reflected across Block&#39;s external storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in corporate communications, financial services communications, fintech, or another complex, regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and storytelling skills, with the ability to translate complex financial products, lending strategies, and business initiatives into clear, compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing proactive communications strategies that strengthen corporate reputation and support business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communications experience, including developing messaging, thought leadership, and media strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional partnership skills, with experience working closely with Legal, Risk, Compliance, Product, and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing media relationships and identifying opportunities to tell proactive business stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to navigate complex or high-profile communications moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset. You enjoy creating new narratives, developing communications programs, and improving how stories are told across an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot;&gt; resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone A: ($122,900 - $184,300)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone B: ($114,200 - $171,400)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone C: ($108,200 - $162,200)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone D: ($98,300 - $147,500)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
